{"id":"n51887-8-2","stage":0,"title":"또 · 还","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n51887-8-2-1","ko":"부장님이 앞에 나와서 노래 부르라는데?","zh":"部长让到前面去唱歌呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"부장님이","meaning":"部长","explanation":"부장：部长；님：尊称后缀。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"부장","audio":"/audio/01b3143b5583938853b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59737","senseId":"1","lemma":"부장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앞에","meaning":"前面","explanation":"앞：前面；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"7","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나와서","meaning":"出现，出场，参加","explanation":"나오다：出现，出场，参加；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"8","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"노래","meaning":"歌，歌曲，唱歌","explanation":"노래：歌，歌曲，唱歌","readings":[{"term":"노래","audio":"/audio/edcad1c9c3dba9e99435.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20195","senseId":"1","lemma":"노래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부르라는데?","meaning":"请，叫","explanation":"부르다：请，叫；라는데：转述听到的情况，并留下确认、补充或对照的语气。","readings":[{"term":"부르다","audio":"/audio/169eb5d7a0d76e97fa7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57304","senseId":"9","lemma":"부르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"01b3143b55839388","term":"부장","zh":"部长","audio":"/audio/01b3143b5583938853b4.mp3","entryId":"59737","definition":"在机关、组织中负责管理一个部门的职位；或指在这个职位的人。","pronunciation":["부장"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"指某种环境或所处的状态。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"出现，出场，参加","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"在某处现身。","pronunciation":["나오다"]},{"id":"edcad1c9c3dba9e9","term":"노래","zh":"歌，歌曲，唱歌","audio":"/audio/edcad1c9c3dba9e99435.mp3","entryId":"20195","definition":"给具有韵律的歌词添加曲子的音乐；或放声唱出那样的音乐。","pronunciation":["노래"]},{"id":"169eb5d7a0d76e97","term":"부르다","zh":"请，叫","audio":"/audio/169eb5d7a0d76e97fa7f.mp3","entryId":"57304","definition":"请求对方过来。","pronunciation":["부르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/bbb3d03f5e2bd303d229.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n51887-8-2-2","ko":"노래는 또 무슨 노래야?","zh":"唱什么歌呀！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"노래는","meaning":"歌，歌曲，唱歌","explanation":"노래：歌，歌曲，唱歌；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"노래","audio":"/audio/edcad1c9c3dba9e99435.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20195","senseId":"1","lemma":"노래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"또","meaning":"还","explanation":"또：还","readings":[{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51887","senseId":"8","lemma":"또","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"3","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"노래야?","meaning":"歌，歌曲，唱歌","explanation":"노래：歌，歌曲，唱歌；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"노래","audio":"/audio/edcad1c9c3dba9e99435.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20195","senseId":"1","lemma":"노래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"edcad1c9c3dba9e9","term":"노래","zh":"歌，歌曲，唱歌","audio":"/audio/edcad1c9c3dba9e99435.mp3","entryId":"20195","definition":"给具有韵律的歌词添加曲子的音乐；或放声唱出那样的音乐。","pronunciation":["노래"]},{"id":"c7c5916d2df73410","term":"또","zh":"还","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3","entryId":"51887","definition":"表示对于前句的内容进行否定或觉得奇怪。","pronunciation":["또"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于强调预料之外的、不合理的事情。","pronunciation":["무슨"]}],"audio":"/audio/54de6ad19eb43e3f86aa.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.44,